      "principle": "A bigamous marriage is a void marriage.",
      "held": "Section 11 of the Hindu Marriage Act declares that any marriage solemnized after the commencement of the Act shall be null and void if it contravenes any of the conditions specified in Clause (i) (iv) and (v) of Section 5.",
